{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"valid\": true,\n  \"entry\": \"左上第一块最大号、最亮的白色粗体标题首先入眼。随后视线容易被下方第二块同样大而醒目的粗体文字吸引。右上角目录字号较小，属于次要视觉信息。\",\n  \"grasp_who\": \"他明知道回去未必能找回过去的亲近，却仍忍不住期待还有可能；更具体的当下处境和选择不确定。\",\n  \"grasp_feel\": \"眷恋、期待、犹疑。\",\n  \"missed\": \"他不愿仅凭找回亲近的希望就回去忍让，而是打算先把眼下生活过稳；虽然仍害怕、没有底气，却不想收回已经作出的打算。实际上他正在试探着向前走，行动逐渐变得坚定。\",\n  \"burden\": [\n    \"两块字号、亮度都很高的大字争夺主视线。第一块表达对过去亲近的眷恋和期待，第二块才交代现实处境与行动选择，核心需要跨块拼接。\",\n    \"第二块文字较长，内部包含先稳定生活、未来独自承担、害怕没底、不愿撤回打算等多个层次，需要读完整段才能理清。\",\n    \"下方较小的总结文字补充了害怕与继续前进之间的关系，这一关键信息不在第一视觉入口中。\"\n  ],\n  \"score\": 2\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "60e33d46-5a25-45f9-9c9f-c486ce48f801", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261110T013249671454Z", "elapsed_seconds": 39.609, "completed_utc": "2026-11-10T01:33:29.288712+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "f1c6307e1726a3bc8969932dd6e17d9bccefc062f65b61493a6731d074850a8d", "attachment_count": 1}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 1, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa23885000025700f6306b1d1f4582896a7370734be506c156dee532fd7d7"}}, "screenshot_evidence": {"complete": true, "kind": "offline_actual_HTTP_response", "directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261110T013249671454Z", "files": ["proof-offline.png"], "sha256": {"proof-offline.png": "9b56d2b8cb7324438600d5326ce8d5a7854f686a84e92f3671dff416d63dbd5e"}}}
